# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: the good_lp patch requires good_lp
# pinned to 1.13.0, and committing the lock lets `cargo patch-crate` resolve
# on a fresh clone. https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# .DS_Store files are created by Macs to store custom attributes
.DS_Store

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Typst
*.pdf
